      "side": 1,
      "message": "Rather than use \"new\" to create an instance of the Builder class, perhaps it would be better to have a builder() function.\n\nAndroidKeyPairGeneratorSpec spec \u003d AndroidKeyPairGeneratorSpec.builder(mContext)\n    .setAlias(...)\n\nFactory methods are generally preferred over new object creation, and allows you to dynamically change the builder object as necessary.",
